                              "code": "\n\t#The asset\u0027s name; its status is the pill beside it\n\treturn system.kanoa.utilities.formatPath(self.view.params.value.assetInfo.assetName or \u0027\u0027, {\u0027locale\u0027: self.session.props.locale})",
