                          "overlayOptOut": true,
                          "transforms": [
                            {
                              "code": "\n\ttagValues \u003d value\n\t#The saved placeholder (custom.tagOEEInfo.loading) until the asset\u0027s own data arrives: show nothing rather than \u0027No mode set\u0027\n\ttry: loading \u003d bool(tagValues[\u0027loading\u0027])\n\texcept: loading \u003d False\n\tif tagValues is not None and loading: return \u0027\u0027\n\tlocale \u003d self.session.props.locale\n\t# No OEE/info yet on an asset with PLC tags: the kanoaMES tags are refilled after a module restart, so stay blank\n\t# until they\u0027re back rather than say the tags aren\u0027t configured (868mwhvq5)\n\tif tagValues is None and self.view.params.value.assetInfo.tagPath: return \u0027\u0027\n\tif tagValues is None: return system.util.translate(\u0027PLC Tags not configured\u0027, locale)\n\tif tagValues[\u0027modeName\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027Production\u0027: return system.util.translate(str(tagValues[\u0027stateName\u0027] or \u0027Unknown\u0027), locale)\n\treturn tagValues[\u0027modeName\u0027] or \u0027No mode set\u0027",
                              "type": "script"
