                    {
                      "code": "\n\tif value is None: return \u0027\u0027\n\t\n\ttagInfo \u003d self.view.custom.tagOEEInfo\n\tif tagInfo is None or not tagInfo.has_key(\u0027modeTypeName\u0027): return \u0027\u0027\n\tif tagInfo[\u0027modeTypeName\u0027] !\u003d \u0027Production\u0027: return \u0027\u0027\n\t#On target needs no icon: only a warning (within threshold) or an error (below target) shows\n\tif value[\u0027oee\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027--kcGood\u0027: return \u0027\u0027\n\tif value[\u0027oee\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027--kcOk\u0027: return \u0027material/warning\u0027\n\tif value[\u0027oee\u0027] \u003d\u003d \u0027--kcBad\u0027: return \u0027material/error\u0027\n\t\n\treturn \u0027\u0027",
